    "created_at": "2026-02-15T22:06:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-15T22:07:00Z",
    "body": "Note: Text inputs (stuff like `<input>` and `<input type=\"search\">`) keep their special sizing behavior, even with primitive appearance. We ran into that in Ladybird because we were treating them as regular elements with no special anything.\n(see https://github.com/LadybirdBrowser/ladybird/pull/7969 for the change and https://github.com/LadybirdBrowser/ladybird/issues/7900 for a website where that matters)",
